\r\n                                        </h1>\r\n                                        <p>\r\n                                        We are bridging the gap between unemployment and entry-level jobs in the technology industry. Become employable in just 4 months by joining us today, we provide you with the right mentorship, tools and contents to upskill yourself.\r\n                                        </p>\r\n                                        <div className=\"contact_hero-privacy\" >\r\n                                            <a href=\"#courses\"><button>Join Us Today!</button></a>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div>\r\n                                <img src={Graduates} alt=\"Graduates\"  className=\"gga_hero-image\" />\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div className=\"container\">\r\n                    <div className=\"course_mode-container\">\r\n                        <div className=\"boxes22\">\r\n                            <div className=\"\">\r\n                                <div className=\"boxes\">\r\n                                    <div className=\"svg-box2\">\r\n                                    <svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 30\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\r\n                                        <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M22.4999 12.5001C22.4999 11.8113 21.9399 11.2501 21.2499 11.2501C20.5599 11.2501 20 11.8113 20 12.5001C20 13.1888 20.5599 13.7501 21.2499 13.7501C21.9399 13.7501 22.4999 13.1888 22.4999 12.5001ZM25.0001 12.5002C25.0001 14.5677 23.3176 16.2502 21.2501 16.2502C19.1826 16.2502 17.5001 14.5677 17.5001 12.5002C17.5001 10.4327 19.1826 8.75022 21.2501 8.75